  message: "Merged as PR #3908, dev SHA f447952fc9. First-try CI pass, no gremlin. Two new linker resolvers (_resolve_site2 + _resolve_site3) consume PR-4 meta + new analyzer-side class.meta['fields'] channel. Site 2 three-step resolution: direct method on type → MRO walk (forward improvement) → fallback to type symbol. Site 3 walks enclosing class's parents via inheritance edges, reads parent.meta['fields'] for receiver name, looks up method on field's type. Dispatch by hint specificity in _try_resolve helper (Site 3 > Site 2 > Site 1). Net deletion ~95 LOC from Java analyzer; net addition ~200 LOC of centralized linker logic. Side-effect-only resolver lookup preserved in Case 3 to keep the return-type-inference cascade chaining var_types across factory patterns. 13 new TestSite2/3 tests + 3 helper-walk tests; 9 existing Java tests migrated to pipeline-mode. ADR-0029 type_hierarchy priority corrected to 60 (was 20). 100% coverage on linker (199 stmts) and Java analyzer (866 stmts). Tag awaits_bakeoff_validation attached BEFORE auto-pr."  # 3bf9
